  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Меня? Мэром?",
   "gap": 0.5
  },
  {
   "v": "arkady",
   "t": "Через два месяца выборы. Ты же хотел новый уровень.",
   "gap": 0.5
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Ну, хотел.",
   "gap": 0.5
  },
  {
   "v": "arkady",
   "t": "Я помогу тебе, а ты поможешь мне.",
   "gap": 0.9
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "To close the first episode, Nina complains on the phone that all the boys chased her at school and somehow she drew this lucky ticket, and a song asks how much money it takes to be happy. See you next time!",
   "gap": 0.5
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "До встречи!",
   "gap": 0.3
